Package: nq-ng
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: NQ contributors
Depends: libc6, python3 (>= 3.8), adduser
Conflicts: nq
Description: local-first operational evidence service
 NQ-ng supervises bounded witness helpers, admits versioned evidence, stores
 durable local custody records, and exposes a read-only local operator view.
 This package is a developer preview and does not initialize or migrate state
 during installation.
